# The PRE-generation registration arm, kept while the generated registry is
# being trusted. `RunTestsLegacy` is the file `RunTests` used to be — 758
# hand-written `addCase(new X())` lines and their 758 imports, unmodified
# except for the class rename — so every gate can be run against the OLD
# registration and the NEW one and the two compared.
#
# DELETE THIS FILE AND test/RunTestsLegacy.hx once the generated registry
# has carried a merged wave green; the switch-over criterion is in
# docs/testing.md § "The registration layer is generated".
test-js-common-legacy.hxml
-js bin/test-legacy.js
